    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "我去，DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 做教程类动效视频已经这么牛了吗，感觉和Opus 5.5没啥区别了😂\n\n我们用它在 OpenDesign 的 Motion Design 里做了一条教程，教大家怎么在其他 coding agent 里接入 OpenDesign API，用上它和其他模型，效果简直不要太好了\n",
    "quoted_tweet": {
      "author": "OpenDesign",
      "username": "OpenDesignHQ",
      "text": "Introducing OpenDesign Motion.\nThe open-source alternative to Claude Motion.\n\nCreate beautiful motion videos with any agent, any model. No Opus 5.5 required.\n\nThis entire launch video was made in OpenDesign.\nMore demos below ↓"
    },
