    "username": "icreatelife",
    "nickname": "icreatelife",
    "text": "Prompt:  🕊️ A PIECE OF MEMORY — JACQUEMUS SURREAL ORIGAMI EDITION\n\nFormat: Vertical 4:5 | Fashion Editorial | Minimalist 2D | Surreal Origami\n\nTransform this photo into a sophisticated, surreal fashion illustration inspired by Jacquemus campaigns, contemporary Japanese minimalism and playful editorial art direction.\n\nPeople: Preserve the original number of people, their poses, gestures and emotional connections.\n\nReinterpret them as elegant, stylized 2D fashion illustrations with simplified faces, minimal facial details, recognizable hairstyles and elongated, graceful silhouettes. Keep the characters charming, effortlessly chic and slightly abstract.\n\nWardrobe: Dress everyone in sophisticated, Jacquemus-inspired minimalist fashion. Think oversized white linen shirts, sculptural dresses, relaxed tailored trousers, asymmetrical silhouettes, elegant summer sets and architectural shapes.",
